{"kind":"type","comment":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"Registers script functions as XML machine cycle handlers, under IDs that a machine\u0027s "},{"kind":"code","content":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"\u003cprocessor\u003e"}]},{"kind":"plaintext","content":" names in "},{"kind":"code","content":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"on-start"}]},{"kind":"plaintext","content":" and  on-finish ."},{"kind":"new_line"},{"kind":"paragraph","content":[{"kind":"new_line"},{"kind":"plaintext","content":"The machine stays XML; the script only supplies what a handler ID does. IDs are "},{"kind":"code","content":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"mmdlib:\u003cname\u003e"}]},{"kind":"plaintext","content":". Machines load after scripts run, and each machine\u0027s handler IDs are checked then: one naming an ID no script or mod registered, or a start handler used for finishing, fails loading. A function that throws is logged, and the machine carries on. Only recipe processors have cycles; a processor naming a Java "},{"kind":"code","content":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"class"}]},{"kind":"plaintext","content":" cannot take these attributes. "},{"kind":"paragraph","content":[{"kind":"new_line"},{"kind":"plaintext","content":"For complete ZenCode examples with imports, loader selection and surrounding configuration, open Examples / XML machines in the wiki navigation."}]}]}]},"display_name":"MachineHandlers","extra":{"loaders":["mmdlib"]},"key":"mods/MMDLib/machines/MachineHandlers","members":{"exists":{"key":"exists","members":[{"kind":"method","comment":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"Whether a handler is registered, from a script or code."}]},"display_name":"exists","extra":{"examples":{"id":["\"mmdlib:crusher_done\""]},"parameter_comment":{"id":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"the handler ID"}]}},"returns":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"true if registered"}]}},"key":"exists","origin":"declared","parameters":[{"display_name":"id","key":"id","type":{"kind":"basic","display_name":"string","key":"java.lang.String","nullable":false}}],"return_type":{"kind":"basic","display_name":"bool","key":"boolean","nullable":false},"static":true,"type_parameters":{}}]},"onFinish":{"key":"onFinish","members":[{"kind":"method","comment":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"Registers "},{"kind":"code","content":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"handler"}]},{"kind":"plaintext","content":" as the cycle-finish handler  mmdlib:\u003cname\u003e , run when a machine finishes a cycle and has placed its outputs. It is an error if the ID is already a handler."}]},"display_name":"onFinish","extra":{"examples":{"handler":["(cycle) \u003d\u003e { if (cycle.machineId \u003d\u003d\n          \"mmdlib:test/script_machine\" \u0026\u0026 cycle.recipe \u003d\u003d\n          \"mmdlib:test/stick_to_apple\") {\n          cycle.level.setBlockAndUpdate(cycle.pos.above(2),\n          cycle.level.getBlockState(cycle.pos.below())); } }"],"name":["\"crusher_done\""]},"parameter_comment":{"handler":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"runs as each cycle finishes"}]},"name":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"the name; the ID is "},{"kind":"code","content":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"mmdlib:\u003cname\u003e"}]}]}},"returns":{"kind":"root","children":[{"kind":"plaintext","content":"the handler\u0027s ID, to write in machine XML"}]}},"key":"onFinish","origin":"declared","parameters":[{"display_name":"name","key":"name","type":{"kind":"basic","display_name":"string","key":"java.lang.String","nullable":false}},{"display_name":"handler","key":"handler","type":{"kind":"java","class_name":"ScriptMachineCycleHandler","display_name":"ScriptMachineCycleHandler","interfaces":[],"key":"zone.moddev.mc.lib.compat.CraftTweaker.ScriptMachineCycleHandler","nullable":false,"package_name":"zone.moddev.mc.lib.compat.CraftTweaker","type_para